# Google Docs Content Hub - ABSOLUTE MODE

**Connected Account:** `aloruhpearlharbor4812@gmail.com`

**Mode:** `||ABSOLUTE MODE||` - Processing only delimited content

A dynamic website that uses Google Documents as the single source of truth, extracting only content marked with absolute value delimiters `||`.

## What is ABSOLUTE MODE?

ABSOLUTE MODE uses mathematical absolute value notation (`||`) as delimiters to mark specific content:


**Only content enclosed between `||` delimiters will be extracted and displayed.**

### Why ABSOLUTE MODE?

✅ **Precision** - Control exactly what content gets displayed  
✅ **Security** - Prevent accidental display of unmarked content  
✅ **Flexibility** - Choose sentences, words, or paragraphs  
✅ **Leaveway** - Fuzzy matching allows ~80% similarity (default)  
✅ **Truth** - Marked content is explicitly identified as safe/true  

## Features

✅ **|| Delimiter Parsing** - Extracts `||marked||` content only  
✅ **Three Content Types:**
   - **Words:** Single word items
   - **Sentences:** Short text (≤20 words, ≤1 sentence)
   - **Paragraphs:** Longer text blocks

✅ **Leaveway Matching** - Allows imperfect delimiters with configurable threshold  
✅ **Single Account** - Connected to aloruhpearlharbor4812@gmail.com  
✅ **Automatic Updates** - Content changes sync automatically  
✅ **Type Classification** - Auto-detects word vs sentence vs paragraph  
✅ **Confidence Scoring** - Shows 100% for perfect matches  

